{"id":"3d82bb5b303fe2a0","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-aronszajn-tree.md","title":"Aronszajn Tree Existence","display":"thm-aronszajn-tree — Aronszajn Tree Existence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-aronszajn-tree","aliases":["58-thm-aronszajn-tree"],"display":"thm-aronszajn-tree — Aronszajn Tree Existence","depends_on":["[[58-df-tree-prop]]","[[58-df-omega1]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-aronszajn-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-aronszajn-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-aronszajn-tree — Aronszajn Tree Existence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa77c5c28538fe4e\" href=\"?note=fa77c5c28538fe4e\" title=\"58-df-tree-prop\">58-df-tree-prop</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"58-df-omega1\">58-df-omega1</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,&lt;_{T})\">\\((T,&lt;_{T})\\)</span> (tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fa77c5c28538fe4e\" href=\"?note=fa77c5c28538fe4e\" title=\"58-df-tree-prop\">58-df-tree-prop</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\)</span> (cofinal-branch predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}aronszajn\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\exists T,&lt;_{T}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\subseteq T\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}aronszajn\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\exists T,&lt;_{T}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\subseteq T\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ZFC proves the existence of an Aronszajn tree.</li>\n<li>Countable levels alone do not prevent a cofinal branch; the absence of such a branch is the defining extra property of an Aronszajn tree.</li>\n<li>Level sizes are required to be <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span>, not equal to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> at every level (the root level is typically a singleton).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tree-prop","status":"resolved","id":"fa77c5c28538fe4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree-prop]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega1","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega1]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree-prop","status":"resolved","id":"fa77c5c28538fe4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S$ ($\\kappa$-tree predicate, see [[58-df-tree-prop]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(T,<_{T})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}aronszajn\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\exists T,<_{T}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,<_{T},\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\subseteq T\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,<_{T},\\omega_1)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"<\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1029,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4030","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-aronszajn-tree.md|58-thm-aronszajn-tree]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["fa77c5c28538fe4e","27ae6ad867a7007d"]}